      "statement": "The prompt rule sets are separated by concern: VISUAL_RULES (visual-first summary layout), CHART_RULES (when to chart and which chart per data shape), DIAGRAM_RULES (when a Mermaid diagram beats a list, plus Mermaid syntax constraints), LENGTH_RULES keyed by SummaryLength, STYLE_RULES from lib/refine.ts for the standing 'always include' styles, LAYOUT_RULES keyed by the display surface (tab ~800px vs sidepanel ~400px), KIND_RULES keyed by SourceKind, and SHARED_RULES about grounding and quoting.",
