      "id": "claim_9f4a0903ab7545ea8c708abfdd9d5d77",
      "statement": "splitInline separates an inline-mode answer into prose and code and works while streaming with an unclosed fence: a fence whose tag is empty or starts with 'openui' is a code fence, other code fences (e.g. ```ts) stay in the prose, and lines outside any fence are prose.",
