    {
      "id": "claim_3da98ba3c8ed4585945b7d77766a4c29",
      "statement": "splitInline has two fallback rules: if no fence was seen and the first non-empty line matches an assignment statement pattern, the whole text is treated as code; if the code block contains no line that looks like a statement, the whole text is returned as prose with empty code.",
